{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-sea-glints-mansions","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"sea-glints-mansions-sothebys-al-zorah-city","about":"Sea Glints Mansions is a limited-edition collection of seven five-bedroom beachfront villas in Al Zorah City. Luxurious residences are located away from the hustle and bustle of the city. The elegant, modern architecture of the villas lives up to the highest standards of design excellence. Each villa has up to 5 bedrooms with bathrooms, built-in wardrobes, ventilation and access to the garden. Individually designed kitchens from European brands boast the highest levels of quality. The master bedroom is decorated in warm tones and features a cozy wood entryway that flows into a walk-in closet. Spacious seafront villas with private gardens and pools offer modern lifestyle and comfort. Immaculately manicured gardens, calming water features and abundant greenery create an oasis of calm for guests and residents. The Clubhouse, located on the golf course, is designed to provide golfers and their guests with the most enjoyable golfing experience possible. With direct access to Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road, Sea Glints Mansions is just 25 minutes from Dubai International Airport, 20 minutes from Sharjah International Airport, 5 minutes from the Medical Center and 35 minutes from the first casino to open in Ras Al Khaimah. This unique place is also easily accessible by boat or yacht, thanks to four modern marinas,which offer convenient year-round parking. Enjoy premium living next to the white sandy beach and bay.","price":8027211,"title":"Sea Glints Mansions","bitrix":{"id":679,"pf_id":"are.2.13667","source":null,"project_id":"Sea Glints Mansions","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Sea Glints Mansions","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Solidere International","project_location":"Al Zorah"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8